.TH UZ 1 "2026-11-20" "uz 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
uz \- unified archive extraction dispatcher
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uz
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIARCHIVE\fR [\fIDESTINATION\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uz
detects the archive format from its magic bytes and dispatches to the
system's own extraction tools. It does not link against compression
libraries and does not implement decompression itself.
.PP
Without
.B \-o
or a destination argument, container archives are extracted into a
directory named after the archive in the archive's own directory.
Bare compressed streams are written into the archive's directory as a
single file.
.PP
Compressed tar streams are recognized by suffix, for example
(\&.tar.gz, .tgz, .tar.xz, .tar.bz2, .tar.zst, .tar.lz4, .tar.lz, .tar.lzma),
and extracted with
.BR tar .
Bare compressed streams such as a single
.B .gz
file are decompressed to one file inside
.IR DESTINATION .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIDIR\fR
Extract into
.IR DIR .
The directory is created if needed. The default is a directory named
after the archive, next to the archive.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Overwrite existing files for zip, 7z, rar/unar and bare compressed streams.
Without this option those formats skip or refuse to overwrite.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-list
List archive contents instead of extracting.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-test
Test archive integrity instead of extracting.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress output from external commands.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Print the detected format and the exact command lines executed.
Password arguments are shown as
.BR *** .
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-password " " \fIPW\fR
Password for encrypted zip, 7z and rar archives.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Usage error or invalid arguments.
.TP
.B 2
Extraction, listing or integrity test failed.
.TP
.B 3
A required external command is missing.
.TP
.B 4
Internal error such as memory allocation or process setup failure.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B uz archive.zip out/
Extract a zip archive into
.IR out/ .
.TP
.B uz -l archive.tar.xz
List the contents of a compressed tar archive.
.TP
.B uz -t package.7z
Test a 7z archive.
.TP
.B uz -p secret encrypted.rar restored/
Extract an encrypted rar archive.
.TP
.B uz -o dest -- -hidden.tar.gz
Extract an archive whose name starts with a hyphen.
.SH NOTES
.B uz
reads no configuration files, keeps no state and performs no network access.
It invokes commands found in
.BR PATH .
.PP
Compressed tar streams require GNU tar's
.B \-I
option.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tar (1),
.BR unzip (1),
.BR 7z (1),
.BR unrar (1)
